         <dc:description>
            <rdf:Alt>
               <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">The Command Line Tools User Guide describes the Xilinx design flow, especially design implementation, and contains information about the Xilinx FPGA and CPLD command line tools, including syntax, input files, output files, and program options.</rdf:li>
